# Runtime state, created next to server.mjs. Never commit it: gateway.db holds settings, API key
# hashes and the spend ledger; the folders hold users' profiles, shared bundles, workspaces and chat
# state; container-pi/models.json holds the API key of the models configured for containers; backups
# hold all of it.
gateway.db
gateway.db-*
*.log
profiles/
files/
shared/
workspaces/
workspaces-archive/
workspaces-chats/
workspaces-run/
container-pi/
backups/
.watchdog-state
node_modules/
extensions/
